We computed a repeated-measures ANOVA with the within-subjects factor Retention and the between-subject factors Day-Night and Consciousness (original experiment with strong masking, replication experiment with strong masking, experiment with weak masking), with the z-transformed scores for the retrieval accuracy as the dependent measure. The interaction of Retention with Consciousness was significant (F (4, 136) = 8.494, p < 0.001, \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
